@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "The Wealth Path";
}

<main class="gw-possibilities">

    <section class="gw-possibilities-hero">
        <div class="gw-hero-overlay"></div>

        <div class="container">
            <div class="gw-hero-content">
                <p class="gw-eyebrow">
                    A path toward greater possibility
                </p>

                <h1>
                    <span aria-hidden="true">🌅</span>
                    The Wealth Path
                </h1>

                <p class="gw-lead">
                    Perhaps wealth begins long before abundance.
                    Perhaps it begins with peace.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The peace of catching up, breathing again, and looking
                    toward tomorrow without yesterday circling overhead.
                </p>

                <a class="gw-button gw-button-primary"
                   href="#wealth-begin">
                    Explore the Path
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>


    <section id="wealth-begin"
             class="gw-journey-section gw-journey-section--warm">
        <div class="container gw-reading-width">
            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                Before getting ahead
            </p>

            <h2>
                Sometimes we simply want to catch up.
            </h2>

            <p>
                We work. We pay what we can. We keep moving forward.
            </p>

            <p>
                But sometimes past obligations continue to follow us.
                Before we can dream about getting ahead, we may simply
                long to take care of what yesterday left behind.
            </p>

            <p class="gw-emphasis">
                Not extravagance.
                <br />
                Not status.
                <br />
                Peace.
            </p>

            <blockquote class="gw-journey-quote">
                Perhaps the first experience of wealth is the moment
                nothing from yesterday is circling overhead anymore.
            </blockquote>
        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="gw-journey-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="gw-section-heading">
                <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                    When money no longer makes every decision
                </p>

                <h2>
                    What would a little more breathing room make possible?
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Financial freedom means something different to everyone.
                    Often, it is not about having more things. It is about
                    having more meaningful choices.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="gw-possibility-grid">
                <article class="gw-possibility-card">
                    <span class="gw-possibility-card__icon"
                          aria-hidden="true">🧾</span>
                    <h3>Catching up</h3>
                    <p>
                        Taking care of past bills and creating enough room
                        to look forward instead of always looking back.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="gw-possibility-card">
                    <span class="gw-possibility-card__icon"
                          aria-hidden="true">🕊️</span>
                    <h3>Finding peace</h3>
                    <p>
                        Sleeping without tomorrow's expenses racing through
                        your mind and waking without yesterday waiting for you.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="gw-possibility-card">
                    <span class="gw-possibility-card__icon"
                          aria-hidden="true">❤️</span>
                    <h3>Showing up</h3>
                    <p>
                        Visiting family, sitting at their table, and being
                        present for moments that cannot be rescheduled.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="gw-possibility-card">
                    <span class="gw-possibility-card__icon"
                          aria-hidden="true">🌱</span>
                    <h3>Having choices again</h3>
                    <p>
                        Making thoughtful decisions with greater confidence
                        instead of allowing fear to make every decision.
                    </p>
                </article>
            </div>

            <p class="gw-section-closing">
                Sometimes financial freedom simply means being able to say,
                “Yes, I can come.”
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="gw-journey-section gw-journey-section--soft">
        <div class="container gw-reading-width">
            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                Your future remains unwritten
            </p>

            <h2>
                Where you are today does not determine
                where you can be tomorrow.
            </h2>

            <p>
                Your present circumstances are real, but they do not have
                to define every chapter that follows.
            </p>

            <p>
                With informed choices, sustained effort, patience, and a
                willingness to learn, new possibilities may become available.
            </p>

            <p>
                No opportunity can promise a particular outcome. But everyone
                deserves the chance to explore whether another path could lead
                toward greater stability, breathing room, and peace.
            </p>

            <blockquote class="gw-journey-quote">
                We do not promise where the path will end.
                We simply believe today does not have to be the final chapter.
            </blockquote>
        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="gw-journey-section">
        <div class="container gw-reading-width">
            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                An opportunity to explore
            </p>

            <h2>
                Perhaps it is time to quietly consider another path.
            </h2>

            <p>
                We will never tell you that the path you have walked was wrong.
            </p>

            <p>
                You worked. You carried responsibilities. You made the best
                decisions you could with what life placed before you.
            </p>

            <p>
                But if that path is no longer taking you where you hope to go,
                perhaps you deserve the opportunity to explore another way
                forward.
            </p>

            <p class="gw-emphasis">
                Not because success is guaranteed.
                <br />
                Because possibility still exists.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="gw-journey-section gw-journey-section--deep">
        <div class="container gw-reading-width">
            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                Supported direction
            </p>

            <h2>
                You will not be left to figure it out alone.
            </h2>

            <p>
                Sometimes people do not lack desire, ability, or determination.
                Sometimes they simply lose sight of the next step.
            </p>

            <div class="gw-simple-list" role="list">
                <div class="gw-simple-list__item" role="listitem">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                    <p>Guidance when the next step feels unclear.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="gw-simple-list__item" role="listitem">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                    <p>Training to help you develop practical skills.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="gw-simple-list__item" role="listitem">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                    <p>Encouragement when progress feels slow.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="gw-simple-list__item" role="listitem">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                    <p>Community so the journey does not feel isolated.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="gw-simple-list__item" role="listitem">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                    <p>Leadership that walks beside you—not above you.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <blockquote class="gw-journey-quote gw-journey-quote--light">
                The future is not promised—but you do not have to explore it alone.
            </blockquote>
        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="gw-journey-reflection">
        <div class="container gw-reading-width">
            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                The strength is yours
            </p>

            <h2>
                We cannot walk the path for you—but we can walk it with you.
            </h2>

            <p>
                No one else can make your choices, develop your skills,
                or take your next step.
            </p>

            <p>
                We can help you recognize possibilities. We can share what
                we have learned. We can provide training, leadership,
                community, and encouragement.
            </p>

            <p>
                But the decision remains yours.
                The effort remains yours.
                The journey remains yours.
            </p>

            <blockquote class="gw-journey-quote">
                But the strength to take the next step
                has been within you all along.
            </blockquote>
        </div>
    </section>


    <section class="gw-journey-conversation">
        <div class="container gw-reading-width">
            <p class="gw-section-kicker">
                Let us begin by listening
            </p>

            <h2>
                Every meaningful path begins with a conversation.
            </h2>

            <p>
                No two people arrive here carrying the same story.
            </p>

            <p>
                Before we talk about an opportunity, we want to understand
                you—where you are today, what you hope tomorrow might look
                like, and what kind of support would genuinely help.
            </p>

            <p>
                There is no pressure and no predetermined destination.
                Just an honest conversation about your goals, the opportunity,
                the work involved, and whether this path fits the future
                you want to build.
            </p>

            <div class="gw-button-row">
                <a class="gw-button gw-button-primary"
                   asp-controller="Home"
                   asp-action="NextChapter">
                    Start a Conversation
                </a>

                <a class="gw-button gw-button-secondary"
                   asp-controller="Home"
                   asp-action="Index">
                    Return Home
                </a>
            </div>

            <p class="gw-section-closing">
                Individual outcomes vary. No income or financial result is
                guaranteed. Any opportunity should be carefully evaluated
                in light of your goals, circumstances, required effort,
                costs, and risks.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

</main>
